Artifact weapons can't be unenchanted with cursed enchant weapon. If
it's non-edged, you can't reduce its enchantment by engraving either.
You *can* (a) hit a disenchanter with it, (b) cast drain life at it,
(c) cancel it to uncursed +0 and start over.

Note that (a) and (b) take some patience and (c) a lot of resources.

